31,1,1,talk,Minako,,"Good morning. We have now passed the first night. If the Seer has discovered anything, now is the time to consider how to share that information without making themselves an immediate target. Does anyone have any observations?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all slept well. It is a bit frightening to think of the Seer's burden, isn't it? I hope they feel safe enough to guide us with their kindness.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"If the Seer is among us, they should be cautious. However, staying silent for too long can be just as dangerous. I'm interested to see if anyone is overly eager to push for a specific target today.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A fascinating dilemma, isn't it? The Seer must balance the necessity of truth with the instinct for survival. I wonder if the wolf is currently pretending to be just as cautious as we are.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"Morning! I'm glad we're all still here. I wonder if the Seer found anything cool? If you're the Seer, don't be scared! We'll protect you if you tell us who the wolf is!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minako,,"Kenji, while your enthusiasm is helpful, encouraging the Seer to reveal themselves immediately could be risky. It might lead the Werewolf to target them tonight. We should proceed with caution and look for subtle clues first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"Minako is right, dear Kenji. We must be very careful. It would be such a tragedy if our helpful Seer were hurt because we were too hasty. Let us move slowly and gently.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree with Minako. Kenji's approach is too reckless. If the Seer reveals themselves now, the Werewolf will simply eliminate them tonight. We need to find a way to verify information without exposing our most valuable asset.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Kenji's eagerness is quite endearing, yet practically perilous. We must treat the Seer's identity as a precious secret, lest the wolf decide to prune our garden of its most useful flower before the first bloom.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Sorry! I didn't mean to be reckless. I just want us to win! I'll be more careful. Does anyone else feel like someone is acting a bit weird today, or is it just me?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Since we have no concrete evidence yet, it is difficult to say who is acting ""weird."" However, I am curious about your intuition, Kenji. Who specifically caught your attention, and why?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"Now, now, let us not be too quick to judge, Kenji dear. It is easy to feel uneasy when we are all so nervous. Perhaps you are just feeling the tension of the game?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Kenji, intuition is a start, but it's not evidence. If you're going to cast suspicion, be specific. Vague feelings of ""weirdness"" can be a tactic used by the wolf to sow discord without taking a real risk.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Mizuki's precision is, as always, impeccable. Kenji, my dear friend, vague suspicions are the playground of the confused or the cunning. If you wish to lead us toward the truth, I suggest you provide a reason for your unease.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I don't have a specific reason! I just meant that everyone is being so serious and formal. It's a bit scary! Maybe the wolf is just pretending to be super smart to trick us?,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minako,,"It seems we are circling back to the same point. While formality can be a mask, it is also a natural response to this situation. Let us focus on the facts. Since no one has claimed a role, we must vote carefully.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Shizue,,"It is a difficult choice, isn't it? I feel so sad that we must choose someone to leave us. Perhaps we should be very gentle and think carefully before we cast our votes.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"Gentleness won't find the wolf, Shizue. Since we have no claims or evidence, we must look at the behavior. Kenji's erratic nature is a distraction, but Benjamin's detachment is also curious. We must vote based on the least reliable logic.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Kenji"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"My detachment, Mizuki? I simply prefer to observe the board before making a move. If my composure is suspicious, then I fear your standard for reliability is quite precarious. I suggest we avoid impulsive decisions.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, why is everyone arguing? I just wanted to help! If we're just guessing, I don't want to pick anyone. But if we have to, let's not be mean about it! I'm just confused!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
