63,2,1,talk,Minako,,"Benjamin has been executed, and Mizuki has been attacked. This suggests the Werewolf felt threatened by Mizuki's logical approach or wanted to remove a strong voice. We must now analyze who benefits most from these losses.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, what a terrible tragedy. Poor Benjamin and dear Mizuki, both gone so soon. My heart truly aches for them. We must stay strong and support each other in these sad times.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"It's so sad! I can't believe Mizuki is gone too. She was really smart, so the wolf must have been scared of her, right? We have to be extra careful now!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,2,talk,Minako,,"If the Werewolf targeted Mizuki, it confirms she was a threat to them. Shizue, you have been very supportive, but your focus on emotion over logic is quite stark now that Mizuki is gone. What are your thoughts on the current situation?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"You are so kind to ask, Minako dear. I only wish to keep us all calm. Perhaps the wolf is trying to make us suspicious of one another so we forget to be friends. What do you think, Kenji?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"I think Shizue is just being nice! But Minako, you're always asking the tough questions. Do you think the wolf is trying to trick us by acting all logical? I'm really confused now!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,3,talk,Minako,,"Logic is a tool, Kenji, not necessarily a trick. However, the fact that the most logical players are gone leaves us vulnerable. Shizue, your desire for friendship is pleasant, but it provides a perfect cover for a Werewolf.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"Oh, Minako dear, it makes me quite sad that you would think so. I only wish for us to be happy and safe. Could it be that the wolf is using logic to cast doubt on a grandmother's heart?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, don't be mean to Shizue! She's just being sweet. Minako, you're acting like a detective in a movie! Maybe the wolf is just trying to make us fight so we don't notice them? Let's just be friends!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Shizue"",""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,4,talk,Minako,,"Friendship is a luxury we cannot afford when a predator is among us, Kenji. Shizue, your kindness is noted, but the wolf often hides behind a gentle mask. Between the two of you, who is more likely to be the wolf?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"That is such a heartbreaking question, Minako dear. I could never point a finger at sweet Kenji; he is far too honest for such a dark role. I only hope we can find peace soon.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want to point fingers at anyone! But Minako, you're being really scary right now. Why are you trying to make us pick between me and Shizue? That's not how friends act!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
